## Official Reference-Axis Map — Structural Use Only

- [Prada Luna Rossa Eau de Toilette](https://www.prada-beauty.com/fragrance/luna-rossa/luna-rossa-eau-de-toilette/3614273478755.html) supplies the athletic sail-racing frame and a lavender/spearmint/amber freshness-to-persistence axis.
- [Creed's official Aventus Q&A](https://creedboutique.com/blogs/creed-journal/aventus-your-questions-answered) supplies a high-contrast fresh-fruity opening moving into dry woods. Its published apple, blackcurrant, pineapple, birch, oakmoss, and related signature cues are exclusion guards, not a formula brief.
- [Creed Absolu Aventus](https://creedboutique.com/products/absolu-aventus?variant=42060743704673) and [Creed's official Absolu background](https://creedboutique.com/blogs/creed-journal/absolu-aventus) supply a more forceful grapefruit/ginger opening tension and a warmer vetiver/patchouli/labdanum rear contrast. Cardamom, cinnamon, pineapple, and a recognizably Aventus-like spice-fruit accord remain excluded.

The retired Explorer / Explorer Extreme comparison axis remains part of V1.1-V1.3 history only. V1.4 does not use it as a design instruction.

### Translation into Silver Traverse

| Reference axis | Abstract lesson admitted | V1.4 translation | Donor identity explicitly rejected |
|---|---|---|---|
| Luna Rossa | cold athletic cloth, mint-lavender air, technical motion | protected lavender/linalyl cloth, peppermint trace, mineral air, pressure/release | shower gel, mint candy, generic blue freshness |
| Aventus | fruit-lit acceleration into a dry projecting rear | brighter grapefruit-rhubarb edge around Pink Pepper; dry outward textile projection | pineapple, apple, cassis, birch smoke, leather, oakmoss/chypre |
| Absolu Aventus | sharper ginger/grapefruit tension and warmer root/earth depth | Ginger ignition plus modest vetiver/patchouli/Azarbre rear deepening | cinnamon/cardamom signature, pineapple-spice accord, sweet labdanum takeover |

## Current Physical Authority Applied

- Pink Pepper EO/Base is absent. Black Pepper EO, Rose Oxide 1%, Damascone Beta 10% in DPG, and Geraniol 10% in DPG remain a **non-equivalent** CURRENT reconstruction hypothesis.
- Methyl Pamplemousse is available only as the recorded 10% in TEC stock.
- Ginger EO is owned neat. It is a natural mixture without applicable exact-name composite decomposition in the current registry; whole-mixture composite OAV is **HOLD**.
- Paradisamide is recorded only as `10%`; carrier, preparation basis, container/lot, and exact active equivalence are unresolved. A preliminary pipeline mapping at 60 uL stock gave modeled OAV 0.0029, below the method's 0.1 dormant-filler boundary. It is therefore rejected from the default CURRENT build and retained only as a contingent, separately gated arm.
- Romandolide, Habanolide, and Ethylene Brassylate are owned neat. Only Romandolide appears in the V1.4 dosing table; alternatives are separate one-musk arms, never additions.
- Parmavert and all tinctures are unavailable. Lemonile neat is depleted and its 1% DPG stock is not used. No hidden substitute is inferred.
- Clearwood, Cedarwood oil Virginia, Lemon FCF oil Sicilian, and Givaudan AIMI are owned neat; only Clearwood is used because the others do not own a missing V1.4 function.
- Ambrox Super is the nominal 33% w/v DEP:ethanol stock; exact density, w/w basis, and active-volume equivalence remain **HOLD**.
- BONTAUX authority applies only to `Lavender EO (BONTAUX SAS)`.
- No cinnamon, cardamom, lactone, pineapple material, cassis base, birch material, or oakmoss/Evernyl is used. The AP-T1-only Cinnamon Bark exception has no authority here.
- Every direct formula aliquot is at least 10 uL. The Peppermint 10% working stock remains future, unprepared, and unauthorized.

## Named Identity and Hedonic-Sport Contract

**Name:** Silver Traverse.  
**Subject:** charged technical sailcloth carrying luminous Pink Pepper.  
**Main note:** Pink Pepper — rosy, effervescent, berry-bright, tensile, and gently woody-spicy; never hot culinary Black Pepper, literal rose, or tropical fruit.  
**Cold state:** Pink-Pepper sparks accelerate through grapefruit-rhubarb light, fresh ginger air, wet silver-mineral facets, and taut lavender cloth.  
**Warm state:** the same cloth stretches outward, dries, and reveals a deeper peppered vetiver/patchouli/Azarbre interior.  
**Invariant cue:** rosy-pepper pressure remains the first object, passes through the aromatic cloth, and returns as dry root/earth/textile grain.  
**Emotional effect:** competitive acceleration followed by warm bodily release; more extroverted than V1.3, but neither loud blue ambrox nor an Aventus clone.

### Hedonic-sport escalation hypothesis

| Path | V1.4 owners | Intended effect | Failure to record |
|---|---|---|---|
| Tension | protected Pink-Pepper nucleus; Ginger spark; grapefruit-rhubarb edge; narrow mineral points | immediate attention, speed, and appetite for the transition | hot pepper, ginger drink, tropical/cassis fruit, citrus glare |
| Motion | Dihydromyrcenol below threshold of leadership; Hedione air; Romandolide outward veil; dry Iso E/ambrox contour | directional athletic projection rather than static freshness | shower gel, laundry musk, metallic ambrox wall, detached projection |
| Comfort | Cashmeran flex, Hexyl Salicylate cloth, Coumarin trace, yielding Azarbre body | tactile landing and bodily ease without sweetness | powder, cream, blank softness, sweet amber |
| Depth | existing Clearwood plus modest Azarbre/vetiver/patchouli increases | warmer root/earth shadow that changes the opening before drydown | muddy patchouli, generic woody amber, chypre/smoke, heavy base |
| Release | Hedione, Helional, Dihydrojasmone, cloth cushion, and explicit negative space | opening acceleration opens into breathable textile volume | diffuse freshness, hollow middle, compensator detection |
| Re-smell moment | 5-120 minute conversion of rosy grapefruit-ginger voltage into warm pepper-root fabric | curiosity through recurrence and opposed textures | fruit disappears into generic woods; seam; fatigue |

### Takeover exclusions

- reject lavender, Dihydromyrcenol, citrus, Ginger, Paradisamide, Hedione, Iso E, ambrox, patchouli, or musk becoming a more accurate name than Pink Pepper;
- reject pineapple, apple, cassis/blackcurrant, guava/passion-fruit, birch smoke, leather, oakmoss, or a recognizable Aventus/chypre accord;
- reject cinnamon/cardamom spice identity, ginger beer, citrus soda, or a sweet labdanum-spice drydown;
- reject literal rose, lychee, plum, lipstick, iris, violet makeup, powder, or cosmetic cream;
- reject hot, dry, culinary Black Pepper, metallic harshness, or trigeminal aggression;
- reject calone/melon, shower gel, generic blue freshness, marine identity, mint candy, or laundry musk;
- reject a larger but anonymous ambrox/woody rear that loses the peppered technical sailcloth.

## Structural Architecture

| Dimension | V1.4 construction | Future physical success criterion |
|---|---|---|
| One subject / cold state | Pink Pepper target; CURRENT spicy pressure plus metallic-rosy surface and berry echo, energized by Ginger and grapefruit-rhubarb light | one luminous, fast rosy-pepper object; not Black Pepper plus rose plus fruit |
| One subject / warm state | the same cloth flexed by Cashmeran and warmed by deeper vetiver/patchouli/Azarbre with outward Romandolide air | dry projected textile that still recalls Pink Pepper rather than a generic woody amber |
| Front glint | Pink Pepper; restrained Bergamot/Cedrat; Methyl Pamplemousse; Ginger; aldehydic/mineral points; peppermint trace | higher acceleration than V1.3 with Pink Pepper still ranked first |
| Near body | BONTAUX lavender, Linalyl Acetate, Ethyl Linalool, Clary Sage, Geraniol | athletic sailcloth remains the carrier, not the subject |
| Living middle | Hedione, Helional, Dihydrojasmone, and Hexyl Salicylate; Paradisamide remains TARGET-only/contingent | fruit-lit opening acquires air and duration without a tropical heart |
| Rear contour | reduced Iso E/ambrox pressure; existing Clearwood/Timberol/Ambermax; modestly increased Azarbre/vetiver/patchouli | deeper and warmer, but more yielding and less crystalline than an ambrox wall |
| Skin/fabric echo | sole Romandolide, Cashmeran, vetiver, patchouli, Iso E, Hexyl Salicylate | projected dry fabric memory without laundry or detached musk |
| Pressure / release | Pink-Pepper/Ginger/grapefruit voltage against air, cloth cushion, yielding wood, and negative space | intense first pull followed by a preferred release rather than linear loudness |
| Temporal recurrence | rosy pepper-peel spark -> pink aromatic fabric -> ginger fades into dry pepper-root/earth grain | late phase recalls the same charged cloth, not merely woods |
| Opposed texture | sparkling, tart, wet-cool, tensile surface / dry, warm, yielding, projected interior | both textures remain causally joined and invite re-smelling |
| Identity-bearing base | peppered aromatic cloth transformed through vetiver/patchouli/Azarbre and one outward musk | base omission loss is describable as loss of Silver Traverse, not only strength |

Every criterion is **NOT TESTED**.

