## Citrus and Base Decision

V1.4 deepens neither the natural-citrus stack nor the amberwood stack. Bergamot and Cedrat remain at V1.3 doses. Only the existing Methyl Pamplemousse stock rises by 20 raw uL, while Ginger supplies a distinct non-citrus ignition hypothesis. This is intended to make the Pink-Pepper opening more dimensional and athletic without making citrus the first object.

The base is deepened selectively by 20 uL each of Azarbre, Indian Vetiver, and Patchouli, funded by Benzyl Benzoate. Iso E and nominal Ambrox are reduced while Romandolide moves the fabric outward. Labdanum stays at its V1.3 trace dose. Thus the rear is predicted to be warmer and more rooted, not simply heavier, sweeter, smokier, or more ambroxan-like.

## Why 37 Rows

The one CURRENT addition is not there to imitate DHP complexity or inflate luxury. Ginger owns immediate acceleration. Paradisamide was screened and removed because unresolved stock plus modeled dormancy did not earn default admission. The remaining 36 rows are source-conserved from V1.3, with functions already assigned to identity, planes, transitions, pressure/release, or controlled finishing. A 31-row compressed arm removes six low-evidence rows at constant total. The complete formula survives only if those rows collectively and individually earn a repeatable name-linked advantage.

## Future Preparation Boundary

There is no mixing order because compounding is not authorized. Before any future physical batch, re-read all authorities; reconcile Paradisamide, Ambrox, and Peppermint stock bases; complete material-specific and formula-level safety review; record container IDs and oxidation state; verify natural composite coverage; and use the linked blinded protocol. Skin work remains separately gated.

## Theory Decision

Silver Traverse V1.4 is admitted as a **36-row TARGET / 37-row CURRENT Aventus/Aventus-Absolu re-axis hypothesis**. Pink Pepper remains the protected hero. V1.4 goes harder on hedonic sport by intensifying tart Ginger/grapefruit ignition, outward textile projection, and warm root/earth contrast—not by importing pineapple, cassis, birch, oakmoss, cinnamon/cardamom, or a second musk. Paradisamide remains TARGET-only and contingent after failing default admission. The complete version is not established as more hedonic than finalized V1.3 until blinded physical module localization and fresh predecessor confirmation exist.

**Final status:** THEORY ONLY / NOT TESTED / NO COMPOUNDING OR PROCUREMENT AUTHORIZED

